# Python strategy / scripts

- Keep modules small; avoid hidden side effects in imports.
- Hard BUY filters live in strategy helpers + `config.yaml` (`hard_reject_*`, continuation bands); wire through `main.py` with `dataclasses.replace` for frozen `Signal` updates.
- Do not open paper on technical BUY alone — paper opens when AI entry sets `ai_gate=passed`.
- Prefer deterministic scoring; no ML in the default scan path.
- Research cohort scripts should support `--actionable-only` when measuring post-filter edge.
- After strategy/config changes that affect BUY quality, point to remeasure via `scripts/research_profit_hold_cohort.py` and note findings under `docs/research/`.
